format: okf
kind: task-journal
date: 2026-08-24
task:
  title: Mia Z.AI Start Plan upstream 404 diagnosis
  evidence:
    captcha:
      request_id: 3Jocw762BuF5LYlliR0SbvlPxP6Zwo0jgzsTUx4dUwI
      status: completed
      browser: Verification complete. Returning to Ciel Runtime
    routed_request:
      provider: zai-start-plan
      model: glm-5.3
      status: 404
      body: 404 page not found
    direct_endpoint_probe:
      openai:
        url: https://zcode.z.ai/api/v1/zcode-plan/chat/completions
        status: 404
        body: 404 page not found
      anthropic:
        url: https://zcode.z.ai/api/v1/zcode-plan/anthropic/v1/messages
        status: 400
        body: '{"code":3007,"msg":"captcha verify failed"}'
      anthropic_size_control:
        small:
          request_bytes: 92
          status: 400
          body: '{"code":3007,"msg":"captcha verify failed"}'
        large:
          request_bytes: 1090084
          status: 400
          body: '{"code":3007,"msg":"captcha verify failed"}'
        finding: Request size alone did not reproduce the routed 404.
    runtime_projection:
      protocol: anthropic_messages
      calculated_url: https://zcode.z.ai/api/v1/zcode-plan/anthropic/v1/messages
      query: empty
  contradiction:
    statement: The global provider config was native_compat=true, while the workspace-scoped config used by the routed launch was native_compat=false.
    resolved_by: Runtime preparation logging exposed the actual route selected from the workspace config.
  root_cause:
    status: superseded-by-runtime-protocol-verification
    runtime_version: 0.2.36-nightly.20260824-184440.2bb06fc
    router_port: 8801
    workspace_id: 9ab536464774
    workspace_config: /home/mia/.config/ciel-runtime/workspaces/9ab536464774/config.json
    workspace_native_compat: false
    actual_prepared_endpoint: https://zcode.z.ai/api/v1/zcode-plan/v1/messages
    expected_endpoint: https://zcode.z.ai/api/v1/zcode-plan/anthropic/v1/messages
    code_evidence:
      - zai-start-plan was listed in CODEX_OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_ROUTER_PROVIDERS.
      - Codex launch policy persisted native_compat=false for that workspace.
      - ZaiStartPlanProviderAdapter supports only anthropic_messages.
      - The measured Start Plan OpenAI path returned 404 while the Anthropic path existed.
  correction:
    status: reverted-before-stable-release
    - Remove zai-start-plan from the Codex OpenAI-compatible provider group.
    - Make the Start Plan adapter enforce its Anthropic-only routing contract even when a legacy workspace setting is false.
    - Make launch policy repair native_compat for any provider whose adapter exposes only anthropic_messages.
  later_contradicting_evidence:
    official_zcode_package: zcode-app-cli@3.8.1-15
    package_paths:
      openai: /api/v1/zcode-plan/chat/completions
      anthropic: /api/v1/zcode-plan/anthropic/v1/messages
    provider_kinds:
      - openai-compatible
      - anthropic
    mia_after_fresh_captcha:
      endpoint: https://zcode.z.ai/api/v1/zcode-plan/anthropic/v1/messages
      status: 405
      body: '{"code":3012,"msg":"method not allowed"}'
    conclusion: >-
      The earlier OpenAI probe's 404 did not prove that Start Plan was
      Anthropic-only. Forcing Codex onto Anthropic contradicted ZCode's dual
      endpoint contract and was reverted in favor of runtime-specific protocol
      selection.
  instrumentation:
    field: endpoint
    redaction: Query and fragment are removed before persistence.
    scope: Native provider preparation, request, and terminal HTTP error activity.
    preparation_event:
      reason: Runtime-scoped headers can pause for interactive verification before an HTTP request is opened.
      invariant: The prepare event records a resolved target but does not claim that the request was sent.
  verification:
    automated:
      focused:
        tests: 39
        result: passed
      unit_group:
        tests: 1182
        result: passed
        skipped: 44
      lint: passed
    mia_runtime: pending
